    "summary": "Stanozolol 50 mg capsule, as listed; a prescription is required. Federal regulations list stanozolol in Schedule III as an anabolic steroid, a class they define by its chemical and pharmacological relation to testosterone. No label was found; FDA's application data list one stanozolol product, a tablet, marked discontinued. Clinical review required.",
